---
interface Props {
  locale?: 'fr' | 'en';
}
const en = Astro.props.locale === 'en';
---

<figure
  class="architecture"
  aria-label={
    en
      ? 'The parent contacts the server. The Windows service contacts the API over HTTPS and exchanges data with the child app over a local pipe.'
      : 'Le parent contacte le serveur. Le service Windows contacte l’API en HTTPS et échange avec l’application enfant par un pipe local.'
  }
>
  <div class="flow">
    <div class="node">
      <span>01 · PARENT</span>
      <strong>Dashboard</strong>
      <p>{en ? 'Rules, schedules and commands' : 'Règles, horaires et commandes'}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="connection">
      HTTPS <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node cloud">
      <span>{en ? '02 · SERVER' : '02 · SERVEUR'}</span>
      <strong>{en ? 'Hono API' : 'API Hono'}</strong>
      <p>PostgreSQL · KV · Better Auth</p>
    </div>
    <div class="connection">
      {en ? 'Outbound HTTPS' : 'HTTPS sortant'} <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node system">
      <span>{en ? '03 · WINDOWS PC' : '03 · PC WINDOWS'}</span>
      <strong>{en ? 'SYSTEM service' : 'Service SYSTEM'}</strong>
      <p>{en ? 'Cached rules · limit enforcement' : 'Règles en cache · application des limites'}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="session">
    <span aria-hidden="true">↕</span>
    <span>{en ? 'Local pipe' : 'Pipe local'}</span>
    <strong>{en ? 'Electron app' : 'Application Electron'}</strong>
    <span>
      {en ? 'Child session · foreground and messages' : 'Session enfant · premier plan et messages'}
    </span>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    {en
      ? 'The service contacts the server. The agent opens no inbound network port on the PC.'
      : 'Le service contacte le serveur. Aucun port réseau entrant n’est ouvert sur le PC par l’agent.'}
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .architecture {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }
  .flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .node {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    background: var(--sl-color-black);
  }
  .node > span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', var(--sl-font);
  }
  p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
  }
  .cloud {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }
  .system {
    border-color: #22a35a;
  }
  .connection {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  .connection span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
  .session {
    display: grid;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .session strong {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  @media (min-width: 70rem) {
    .flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 4rem 1fr 4rem 1fr;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .connection span {
      transform: none;
    }
    .session {
      margin-left: 70%;
    }
  }
</style>
